						<div class="comment-author vcard" itemprop="author" itemtype="https://schema.org/Person" itemscope>
							<cite itemprop="name" class="fn"><a href="https://www.blogger.com/profile/15613109310856994229" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Ricardo Alexandre Trombetta</a></cite>						</div>

													<div class="entry-meta comment-metadata">
